Obwanchani n'omogoko, Nabomenye as'ense;
Haleluya! Tonyore omorembe;
Haleluya! Tonyore omorembe.

Intwe twensi natomenye, As'obosio bwao;
Chinguru chionsi nobwate, Obutore ekina;
Nchuo 'Monene! Intwe abanto bao!
Nchuo 'Monene! Intwe abanto bao!

Nyasae oito norwaki, Nguba nekerwanero,
Natokonye korw' obobe obwo bwatobuire;
Omogambi bw' obobe Oimokereirie igoro,
Bong'ainereri' obonene 'bekire 'kero eke;
As' ens' etari mosani.

Ntokonyara kwerwanera, Bwango nigo toraitwe,
'Monto nar' ogotokonya, Nyasae bwek' omorure;
Mwaboria ning'o 'yo? n'kristo Yes' akorokwa;
Omwan' o Nyasae; Bweka, onde tari, Orabue 'Se 'segi.

Tom'omobaso chinsa chionsi;
Mbare n'enchera ase ring'ana;
Simeka chimbusuro chingiya;
Tom 'omobas 'omuya.

Tindigeti'obonene  gos'ogosikwa;
Gatwasoir'egonde  ya  Yes'Omuya;
Intwe  n'obwanchani  bwatoretire!
Oyorangerigwe Oyio noyoye.

hymns.refrain:
Ogokonya  nokwao  n'obuya  bwonsi,
Ogokonya  nokwao  n'obuya  bwonsi;
Ntob'ensemo yao 'Monene botambe.

verses:
Inchwo mwegenete, 'gw'okorangeria;
Bionsi korw' as' Are, naye moe bo,
Yeso nagwanchere Korach'as'Are;
Nako'ogosesenigw'okonene.

hymns.refrain:
'Bogim' obonge, 'bogim' bonge;
Erio babe n'obogim' obonge
'Bogim' obonge, 'bogim' obonge;
Erio nabe n'obogim' obonge.

verses:
Chingencho mwakorerwe mwanche igo nomokia,
Mwensi morek' enchera igo bun' etaya;
'Bororo n'emekono, N'emechando Yaino;
Ogotemwa ao ao, Goika ogokwa kwaino.

Yonsi nero eng'eria, Bun'Ere anyorete,
Nebe buna obororo, Igoro korw'ense;
Orogendo rwa Yeso, Rigereria Igoro;
'Mechando Y'ense'eye, Nyebue as'are.
